Day hybrid RTH bot — stacked books (separate long + short).

Long: 15/5/1 bullish, 1m pullback, w4_no_noon windows, 1R, 1 slot.
Short: 15/5/1 bearish, quiet 1m, continuous RTH scan, 2 slots, max 12/day.
